tapir (0.2.0) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Run Tapir as podman containers under systemd, one instance per solidarity
    farm, with a shared Keycloak (realm per instance).
  * The package only ships tapir-instance, tapir-kcadm and tapir-manage;
    installations of the native 0.1 package are adopted.

 -- Jörg Bernau <Joerg.Bernau@onesimus.io>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:05:01 +0200

